  "behavior": [
    "A seal_output or post-seal verify_output exception makes final report status failed, exit_code2, artifact_seal null, artifact_seal_status unsealed_finalization_error; original phase/type/message retained.",
    "Exact serialized pre-seal report preserved once using exclusive report-before-seal-failure.json before final report replacement. No overwriting a backup, no retry chain.",
    "A written or partially written seal.json is left byte-for-byte untouched. The final report describes it only as a failed attempt; never re-seals, deletes it, ignores paths or treats raw/statistics/parity success as seal success.",
    "If failed seal fingerprinting itself errors, metadata_status unavailable and original error are recorded, while still writing a writable failed report. Missing fingerprints are not zeros.",
    "If output/backup or final failure metadata cannot be written, CLI returns2 and stderr explicitly says final status failed/unsealed and metadata retention failed. No claim a stale pre-seal report has become final.",
    "Normal success retains valid sealed/0; a stopped ordinary parity failure retains valid failure seal/1; owned writer stopping, terminal retention, cache and all existing gates remain unchanged."
  ],
